1
00:00:00,869 --> 00:00:02,969
(Howard:)Glad to hear it.

2
00:00:04,139 --> 00:00:06,839
(Sheldon:)I'll be able to return
to work tomorrow.

3
00:00:07,809 --> 00:00:10,239
(Raj:)Yay.

4
00:00:10,245 --> 00:00:12,715
(Sheldon:)Well, why isn't
everyone happy?

5
00:00:12,714 --> 00:00:16,454
(Sheldon:)Your little ray of sunshine
is ready to beam again.

6
00:00:17,285 --> 00:00:19,355
(Penny:)You really don't know why?
No.

7
00:00:19,354 --> 00:00:22,284
But I knew that his “yay”
was sarcastic.

8
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:24,390
(Sheldon:)Not bad for a guy
whose last bowel movement

9
00:00:24,392 --> 00:00:26,562
(Sheldon:)sounded like rain on a roof.

10
00:00:28,597 --> 00:00:31,227
(Leonard:)Let me refresh your memory.

11
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:33,263
(Sheldon:)Penny,

12
00:00:33,268 --> 00:00:36,098
(Sheldon:)rub Vicks on my chest.

13
00:00:36,104 --> 00:00:38,904
(Penny:)Sheldon, I cooked you breakfast.

14
00:00:38,907 --> 00:00:40,337
(Penny:)I made your bed.

15
00:00:40,342 --> 00:00:42,242
(Penny:)I checked your mouth for thrush.

16
00:00:43,111 --> 00:00:45,181
(Penny:)You can rub your own chest.

17
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,780
(Sheldon:)Oh, sure, grope every other
male on the planet,

18
00:00:47,782 --> 00:00:49,382
(Sheldon:)but draw the line with me.

19
00:00:51,186 --> 00:00:53,716
(Bernadette:)I brought you a little
care package from work.

20
00:00:53,722 --> 00:00:54,922
(Bernadette:)It's our latest
antiviral

21
00:00:54,923 --> 00:00:56,893
(Bernadette:)and the best decongestant
we make.

22
00:00:56,892 --> 00:00:59,592
(Sheldon:)I hope laughter
is the best medicine,

23
00:00:59,594 --> 00:01:03,024
(Sheldon:)'cause this care package
is a joke.

